[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14100.55, "timestamp": "03:55:00", "text": "后退。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14103.67, "timestamp": "03:55:03", "text": "别忘了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14105.269, "timestamp": "03:55:05", "text": "好的。好的。我们需要到达……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14107.189, "timestamp": "03:55:07", "text": "问号。快点。好的。我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14108.55, "timestamp": "03:55:08", "text": "未来。我来了。我来了。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14110.87, "timestamp": "03:55:10", "text": "去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14112.95, "timestamp": "03:55:12", "text": "还有，记得吃饭，因为如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14115.269, "timestamp": "03:55:15", "text": "不吃东西，你的健康状况会下降。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14118.469, "timestamp": "03:55:18", "text": "那确实有这么回事。那确实有这么回事。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14123.99, "timestamp": "03:55:23", "text": "我会成功的。不用担心。我有足够的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14132.15, "timestamp": "03:55:32", "text": "看看这些人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14142.15, "timestamp": "03:55:42", "text": "对了，别摔倒了。它做了很多事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14144.07, "timestamp": "03:55:44", "text": "损害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14147.05, "timestamp": "03:55:47", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14149.349, "timestamp": "03:55:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14151.67, "timestamp": "03:55:51", "text": "那么，谁来抢鸡蛋呢？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14154.67, "timestamp": "03:55:54", "text": "抓住鸡蛋。实际上，你建造了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14157.189, "timestamp": "03:55:57", "text": "楼层。好的。谁将要"}]